# Monitor profiles (Lua)

Create a layout with nwg-displays, then copy ~/.config/hypr/monitors.lua
into this directory with a unique .lua filename, such as Office.lua.
Keep default.lua as the bundled profile.

Choose a profile from Quick Settings (SUPER SHIFT E). MonitorProfiles.sh
copies the selected .lua file to ~/.config/hypr/monitors.lua and reloads
Hyprland. The current layout is overwritten; save it as a profile first
if you want to keep it.
